        "invalid regex /(?=x)/; GitLab evaluates the rule as false"
      ],
      "vars_used": [
        [
          "MYSTERY",
          "unknown"
        ]
      ],
      "why": "the pattern is validated before the unknown left side is consulted"
    },
    {
      "id": "re-lhs-unknown-str-rhs",
      "expr": "$MYSTERY =~ \"x\"",
      "result": "false",
      "notes": [
        "the right side of =~ is not a /regex/; GitLab treats the match as false"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "re-lhs-bool",
      "expr": "true =~ /x/",
      "result": "false",
      "notes": [
        "the left side of =~ is not a string"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "re-lhs-re",
      "expr": "/a/ =~ /a/",
      "result": "false",
      "notes": [
