        "expression does not parse (unexpected character `b`); GitLab evaluates it as false"
      ],
      "why": "GitLab's lexer has no escapes: the string ends at the second quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "syntax-dollar",
      "expr": "$",
      "result": "false",
      "notes": [
        "expression does not parse (`$` with no variable name); GitLab evaluates it as false"
      ]
    },
    {
